flowchart TB
  n1["1. Pick protocol<br/>SAML or OIDC<br/>(likely SAML for non-gallery)"]:::n
  n2["2. Decide required claims<br/>sub, email, name, UPN"]:::n
  n3["3. Generate SP Entity ID<br/>+ callback / ACS URL"]:::n

  h1["4. Normain → KPMG hand-off<br/>• Protocol choice<br/>• Claim list<br/>• SP Entity ID<br/>• Callback URL<br/>• Permissions doc (delegated only)"]:::h

  k1["5. NITSO security review<br/>+ approval"]:::k
  k2["6. KPMG admin creates<br/>non-gallery enterprise app<br/>in KPMG Global Entra"]:::k
  k3["7. Configure SSO settings<br/>(Normain's callback URL,<br/>SP Entity ID)"]:::k
  k4["8. Configure claim mapping<br/>(email, name, UPN, etc.)"]:::k
  k5["9. Assign KPMG Sweden<br/>users to the app"]:::k

  h2["10. KPMG → Normain hand-off<br/>• App ID<br/>• Federation metadata<br/>(SAML XML or OIDC discovery URL)<br/>• Signing certificate"]:::h

  n4["11. Configure auth library<br/>with KPMG's metadata"]:::n
  n5["12. Implement sign-in route<br/>(redirect users to KPMG IdP)"]:::n
  n6["13. Implement callback handler<br/>validate signature, iss, aud"]:::n
  n7["14. Map identity claims to<br/>Normain user accounts"]:::n

  k6["15. KPMG provides test user"]:::k
  n8["16. End-to-end test<br/>full sign-in flow"]:::n
  k7["17. KPMG adds remaining<br/>Sweden users to<br/>assignment list — GO LIVE"]:::k

  n1 --> n2 --> n3 --> h1 --> k1 --> k2 --> k3 --> k4 --> k5 --> h2 --> n4 --> n5 --> n6 --> n7 --> k6 --> n8 --> k7

